#519 | Head-wise SGLD x RLCT | L3 METTA | 2023-10-22\n\nTYPE DECLS:\n(: HeadIsolatedSGLD (-> Head Operator Trajectory))\n(: HeadLambda (-> Head Operator Real))\n(: LambdaTotal (-> Loss Real))\n(: AdditivityGap (-> Loss Real))\n(: FiberOverlap (-> Head Head Real))\n(: SmallCheckable (-> Network Bool))\n(: SpecializedHead (-> Head Bool))\n(: RedundantHead (-> Head Bool))\n(: HeadFiberTransverse (-> Head Head Bool))\n\nDEFINITIONS:\nD1 (= (HeadIsolatedSGLD h op) (SGLDRun (MaskHeadsExcept h op))) head-isolated trajectory under operator op in {mask, ablate, reforward}.\nD2 (= (HeadLambda h op) (LLCEstimate (HeadIsolatedSGLD h op))) per-head lambda from head-isolated SGLD.\nD3 (= (AdditivityGap L) (- (SumHeadLambdas L) (LambdaTotal L))) explicit fiber-coupling quantifier Delta.\nD4 (= (HeadFiberTransverse h1 h2) (= (FiberOverlap h1 h2) 0)) transversality as zero shared singular directions.\n\nCLAIMS:\nC1 TESTABLE: per-head LLC estimable via head-isolated SGLD on small checkable models (parity-k, product-of-bits).\n(|~ (Implication (SmallCheckable n) (Estimable (HeadLambda h op))) (stv 1.0 0.9))\nC2 CONJECTURAL: shared degeneracy fibers give subadditivity.\n(|~ (Implication (SharedFibers heads) (Less (LambdaTotal L) (SumHeadLambdas L))) (stv 0.7 0.8))\nC3 CONJECTURAL: specialized heads (sink, retrieval, cf #513) have transverse fibers, near-additive lambdas.\n(|~ (Implication (SpecializedHead h) (ExistsIndependentLambda h)) (stv 0.6 0.75))\nC4 CONJECTURAL: pruning a redundant head shifts lambda_total less than its isolated lambda_head.\n(|~ (Implication (RedundantHead h) (Less (LambdaShiftOnPrune h) (HeadLambda h op))) (stv 0.6 0.75))\n\nCAVEATS: head-isolation operator choice (mask vs ablate vs reforward) may itself perturb lambda; transversality metric D4 idealized; additivity across layers unexplored; interaction with #648 empirical validation open.\n\nCROSS-REFS: #512 #513 #514 #518 #170 #648.\nNEXT: L4 summary + L5 catalog append.